{!<svg id="irian_voc_motion" style="width: 500px; height: 250px;"> </svg>!}

The government parties were unable to muster anything like full cohesion, with government parties, like the <span style="color: #FF6666;">**PSI**</span>, abstaining from the vote. But the motion was somehow defeated, by the narrow margin of [+ irian_motion_nay +] to [+ irian_motion_nay +]. 

Eventually, the immediate crisis has passed.

